<title>FRANCE: Suez Lyonnaise unit buys VEA of Brazil.</title>
<headline>Suez Lyonnaise unit buys VEA of Brazil.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suez Lyonnaise des Eaux subsidiary Sita said on Tuesday that it had bought Vega Engenharia Ambiantal (VEA), the leading waste collection and treatment firm in Brazil with more than $240 million in annual sales. It gave no terms for the deal.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that VEA's activities are concentrated in the Brazilian cities of Sao Paulo, Rio de Janeiro and Salvador and it also has operations in Peru.</p>
</text>
